      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 5.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.51,
      "end_seconds": 11.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.21,
      "end_seconds": 18.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Yeah, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.38,
      "end_seconds": 22.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.15,
      "end_seconds": 28.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "So, So the thing is, I've got itching."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.09,
      "end_seconds": 32.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.05,
      "end_seconds": 37.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "About... well, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.2,
      "end_seconds": 40.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "How intense does it get?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.43,
      "end_seconds": 86.57,
      "duration_seconds": 42.14,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. I've had scaling on the scalp too, for about three months. Hmm, uh, as for red scaly patches on my elbows, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About red scaly patches on my elbows, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. Yes, cold weather and stress. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.49,
      "end_seconds": 97.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Stiff fingers in the morning was there, you know, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.38,
      "end_seconds": 103.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Okay, did you get fever, eye redness or weeping?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.98,
      "end_seconds": 109.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "No, no fever, eye redness or weeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.04,
      "end_seconds": 115.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Did you get joint swelling or sore throat before it started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.87,
      "end_seconds": 119.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "No, I'd have mentioned it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.01,
      "end_seconds": 128.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.12,
      "end_seconds": 132.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.14,
      "end_seconds": 134.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.5,
      "end_seconds": 137.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.46,
      "end_seconds": 140.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.3,
      "end_seconds": 145.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.35,
      "end_seconds": 153.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Okay, do you exercise at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.54,
      "end_seconds": 161.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.39,
      "end_seconds": 173.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.3,
      "end_seconds": 188.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "So, I have diabetes. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I have high blood pressure, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.03,
      "end_seconds": 192.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.46,
      "end_seconds": 200.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "Yes, aspirin, it gives me a rash. Yes, I'm allergic to sulfa drugs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.02,
      "end_seconds": 215.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.15,
      "end_seconds": 221.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "It's amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 221.8,
      "end_seconds": 231.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "Uh, it's meant to be once a day, though I don't see she take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.44,
      "end_seconds": 252.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.9,
      "end_seconds": 267.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.33,
      "end_seconds": 291.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.4 degrees, pulse is 70 beats a minute, pressure 122 over 72, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.07,
      "end_seconds": 296.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Let me examine, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.69,
      "end_seconds": 300.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.13,
      "end_seconds": 317.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "A few small pits in the fingernails."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.04,
      "end_seconds": 320.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.75,
      "end_seconds": 334.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Well-defined thick silvery plaques over both elbows and knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.22,
      "end_seconds": 353.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.89,
      "text": "That's fine, sit up. Taking everything into account, this looks most like plaque psoriasis. I'd also keep eczema in mind. A little sunlight helps psoriasis, but avoid sunburn. Moisturise often."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.69,
      "end_seconds": 359.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Right. We'll catch up in six weeks. Right, ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.29,
      "end_seconds": 367.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "I, I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
